wh40k-class-specialization-assassin-executioner-name = Executioner's Blade
wh40k-class-specialization-assassin-executioner-description = Ambushes, light blades, marks, and focused elimination.

wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-01-name = Executioner's Discipline
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-01-description = Unlocks the Executioner's Blade stance. Bonuses require a suitable light melee weapon or throwing blade.
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-02-name = Backstab
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-02-description = Uses the existing server-side behind-target check and moderately improves one rear hit. A prone target is never a free execution.
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-03-name = Patient Blade
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-03-description = The first prepared strike from concealment gains a small accuracy bonus but always reveals the Assassin.
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-04-name = Read the Arteries
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-04-description = Examining a visible marked target shows whether it is wounded, bleeding, or critical.
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-05-name = Thrown Needle
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-05-description = Enhances the next throw of a real held light blade or dart, briefly slowing on hit. The projectile is not created and can be lost.
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-06-name = Break the Grip
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-06-description = A melee hit on an unprotected target improves the normal disarm chance. It cannot disarm through armor or at range.
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-07-name = Execution Mark
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-07-description = Marks one visible dangerous target for Executioner's Blade combos. The timed mark cannot be seen through walls and grants no damage by itself.
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-08-name = Venomous Edge
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-08-description = Applies one charge from a real chemical or poison consumable to a suitable weapon. Weapon type and target defense are checked, and charges are finite.
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-09-name = Sever Tendons
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-09-description = An accurate strike temporarily slows a marked target only if it lands and suitable armor does not absorb it.
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-10-name = Unseen Cut
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-10-description = The first attack from active camouflage against a marked target gains a controlled bonus, then camouflage always ends.
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-11-name = Rhythm of Blood
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-11-description = A successful backstab against a bleeding target reduces the next precise strike's delay within a safe cap.
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-12-name = Feigned Surrender
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-12-description = Briefly weakens the Assassin's stance to sidestep the target's first melee attempt. It avoids one attack and grants no invulnerability.
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-13-name = Blade Between Plates
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-13-description = With strict armor-type checks, improves one focused strike without ignoring heavy armor or raising general body damage.
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-14-name = Fugitive Catcher
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-14-description = A thrown hit keeps a fleeing target slowed longer. Repeated hits do not stack it.
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-15-name = Remove the Witness
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-15-description = Performs a long, loud, visible finisher on a prone or fully immobilized hostile NPC. Against players it becomes limited nonlethal control.
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-16-name = Silent Hunt
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-16-description = Eliminating a marked NPC speeds the return to stealth but restores no health, toxins, ammunition, or action charges.
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-17-name = Lethal Dose
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-17-description = Improves the next real contact poison against a marked target, with a strict cap and protection from repeated application.
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-18-name = Cut the Thread
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-18-description = A short precise strike interrupts a hostile NPC action. Against players it causes only a brief counterable disruption, never permanent ability denial.
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-19-name = Unerring Choice
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-19-description = After backstabbing a marked target, briefly protects against its first retaliation only; other targets and attacks remain fully dangerous.
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-20-name = Final Sentence
wh40k-class-skill-assassin-executioner-20-description = A long-prepared rear finisher against a visible marked target with high capped damage and a long cooldown. Movement, obstacles, or revelation cancel it; armor remains effective and players are never instantly executed.

ent-ActionWh40kAssassinThrownNeedle = Thrown needle
    .desc = Prepare the next throw of the real held light blade to slow on impact.
ent-ActionWh40kAssassinDisarmGrip = Break the grip
    .desc = Prepare the next melee hit to deal bounded stamina pressure.
ent-ActionWh40kAssassinExecutionMark = Execution mark
    .desc = Mark one visible hostile target for Executioner's Blade combinations.
ent-ActionWh40kAssassinPoisonEdge = Venomous edge
    .desc = Consume toxin from a real held bottle to coat the held light weapon for one hit.
ent-ActionWh40kAssassinTendonCut = Sever tendons
    .desc = Prepare one slowing melee hit against a marked target.
ent-ActionWh40kAssassinFalseSurrender = Feigned surrender
    .desc = Briefly prepare a bounded defensive response that breaks on movement or attack.
ent-ActionWh40kAssassinRemoveWitness = Remove the witness
    .desc = Begin an interruptible rear finisher against a downed hostile. Players receive nonlethal stamina pressure.
ent-ActionWh40kAssassinLethalDose = Lethal dose
    .desc = Consume toxin from a real held bottle for one stronger, capped weapon coating.
ent-ActionWh40kAssassinSeverThread = Cut the thread
    .desc = Prepare one marked-target hit that deals bounded stamina pressure.
ent-ActionWh40kAssassinFinalSentence = Final sentence
    .desc = Begin a long interruptible rear finisher against a visible marked hostile. Players are never instantly executed.
